OL,3,GNEWSAGroups can bid for share of #100k
OL,4,Ahomelessness grant
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomelessness charities and groups can
OL,7,Fbid for funding as a council announces
OL,8,Fa #100,000 grant.
OL,10,FDurham County Council said
OL,11,Forganisations supporting people
OL,12,Fsleeping rough could make multiple
OL,13,Fapplications for individual projects up
OL,14,Fto a total of #10,000.
OL,16,FA recent government survey said rough
OL,17,Fsleeping was rising faster in
OL,18,Fnorth-east England than other parts of
OL,19,Fthe country, with 162 people in the
OL,20,Fregion sleeping on the streets on a
OL,21,Fsingle night in the autumn of 2025 ` up
OL,22,Ffrom 124 in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
