OL,3,GNEWSAGroups can bid for share of #100k
OL,4,Ahomelessness grant
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said it encouraged "as many
OL,7,Forganisations as possible working in
OL,8,Fthis area to bid for this support",
OL,9,Fwith applications running from Thursday
OL,10,Fto 30 October.
